{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41438","headline":"病中书怀寄王二十六 · 李建勳","name":"病中书怀寄王二十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落叶满山州，闲眠病未瘳。\n窗阴连竹枕，药气染茶瓯。\n路匪人遮去，官须自觅休。\n焉宜更羸老，扶杖作公侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李建勳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41438.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41438","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}